        "text": "The token-movers skill issued its first BREAKDOWN verdict since August 18. MIROSHARK dropped 12.1% to $0.000002041 on $5.95K volume (2.0× the 7-day average), triggered by a single $2.84K sell. Price now down 25% over both 7d and 30d windows.",
